<div id="release-app">
<header class="release-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SCENARIO 01 / FROM PLAN TO REVIEW</div><h1>一次发布，走完整条业务链。</h1><p>你是项目负责人。把三项发布验收交给团队，完成检查，再让后台生成准备摘要。</p></div><span class="release-duration">约 1 分钟体验</span></header>
<div id="release-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<section class="release-welcome" id="release-welcome"><div><span class="release-kicker">一个可以真正操作的项目</span><h2>从空白空间开始，<br>直到第一份自动回顾。</h2><p>创建你的专属体验空间，所有操作都会保存。任务交给真实后台进程处理；刷新页面后可以继续，不与已有后台账号或数据混用。</p><div class="release-actions"><button id="release-start" class="button primary">创建体验空间 ↗</button><span>无需邮箱 · 两小时有效</span></div></div><ol><li><b>01</b><div><strong>计划</strong><span>创建项目，生成验收清单</span></div></li><li><b>02</b><div><strong>验收</strong><span>逐项完成，写入真实数据</span></div></li><li><b>03</b><div><strong>交付</strong><span>延迟入队，后台生成摘要</span></div></li><li><b>04</b><div><strong>回顾</strong><span>自动调度，持续生成新报告</span></div></li></ol></section>
<div id="release-workspace" hidden>
<div class="release-toolbar"><span id="release-space"></span><div><button id="release-refresh" class="release-quiet">同步状态</button><button id="release-export" class="release-quiet">下载体验记录 ↓</button></div></div>
<ol class="release-steps" id="release-steps"><li><b>01</b><span>创建项目</span></li><li><b>02</b><span>完成验收</span></li><li><b>03</b><span>生成发布摘要</span></li><li><b>04</b><span>自动回顾</span></li></ol>
<div class="release-grid"><div class="release-main">
<section class="release-card release-chain"><span class="eyebrow">ONE RELEASE / THREE SERVICES</span><h2>一份摘要，如何跨服务完成？</h2><p>提交后由队列串联两个真实协议服务。TCP 读取当前验收快照；gRPC 根据快照执行发布规则；规则通过后才保存摘要。每次自动回顾也重新执行整条链路。</p><ol class="release-chain-flow"><li><b>01 · TCP</b><span>验收数据服务</span><small>读取已保存的任务数量与完成数</small></li><li><b>02 · gRPC</b><span>发布规则服务</span><small>要求清单非空且全部完成</small></li><li><b>03 · 队列</b><span>交付发布摘要</span><small>保存通过规则的那次快照</small></li></ol><div id="release-chain-status" role="status">提交第一份摘要后，在这里观察真实调用。</div><div id="release-exchanges"></div><p class="release-hint">可验证业务拦截：提交摘要后，在 5 秒等待期内重新打开一项验收。TCP 将读取最新状态，gRPC 会拒绝本次交付。恢复验收后可重新提交。</p></section>
<section class="release-card"><div class="release-card-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RELEASE PLAN</span><h2 id="release-project-title">给这次发布起个名字</h2></div><span id="release-project-id" class="release-tag">尚未创建</span></div><form id="release-project-form"><label for="release-project-name">项目名称</label><div class="release-input-row"><input id="release-project-name" value="Loom 体验版发布" required maxlength="100"><button class="button primary">建立发布计划</button></div><p class="release-hint">将创建三条真实验收任务；你可以逐项完成，也可以重新打开。</p></form><div id="release-plan" hidden><div class="release-progress"><span id="release-task-progress"></span><progress id="release-progress" max="3" value="0"></progress></div><div id="release-tasks"></div><p class="release-evidence" id="release-task-evidence"></p></div></section>
<section id="release-delivery" class="release-card"><div class="release-card-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">BACKGROUND DELIVERY</span><h2>把准备结果交给后台</h2></div><span id="release-delivery-status" class="release-tag">等待验收</span></div><p>完成清单后提交摘要。任务会延迟 5 秒进入可执行状态，由队列消费者生成报告，你可以留在这里观察或稍后回来。</p><button id="release-report" class="button primary" disabled>提交发布摘要 ↗</button><div id="release-job" class="release-job-empty">完成三项验收，开启下一步。</div><div id="release-reports"></div></section>
<section id="release-review" class="release-card"><div class="release-card-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP THE TEAM IN SYNC</span><h2>让回顾按时发生</h2></div><span id="release-schedule-status" class="release-tag">尚未启用</span></div><p>体验中使用每 15 秒一次的加速节奏。调度器自动创建任务，队列负责执行，刷新报告列表即可看到结果；空间过期后会自动停止。</p><div class="release-actions"><button id="release-schedule" class="button primary" disabled>启用自动回顾</button><span id="release-next">先生成第一份摘要</span></div></section>
</div><aside class="release-aside">
<section class="release-card release-outcome"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT MOVE</span><h2 id="release-next-title">建立发布计划</h2><p id="release-next-description">先为项目命名，创建发布清单。</p><div id="release-checks"></div><small>这里验证发布准备流程，不会部署项目或向外发送通知。</small></section>
<section class="release-card"><div class="release-card-heading"><h2>业务活动</h2><span id="release-sync" class="release-hint">实时记录</span></div><ol id="release-events" class="release-timeline"></ol></section>
